==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/hauːr/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|auːr|lang=is}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|is|non|hár}}, {{m|non|hór}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*hauhaz}}.

====Adjective====
{{is-adj|hærri|hæstur}}

# [[high]]
#: [[múr|Múrinn]] er '''hár'''.
#:: The wall is '''high'''
# [[tall]]
#: Guð minn almáttugur! Þú ert orðinn svo '''hár'''!
#:: My god almighty! You've gotten so '''tall'''!

