* {{l|is|há-}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{der|is|non|hár}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*hērą}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|n|hárs|hár}}

# {{senseid|non|hair}} [[hair]]
